<title>UK: Pearson unit buys Telecomeuropa.</title>
<headline>Pearson unit buys Telecomeuropa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pearson Professional, part of Pearson Plc's information division, has bought specialist newsletter and database publisher Telecomeuropa for 2.1 million stg, Pearson said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Pearson said the buy would strengthen FT Media and Telecom's position as a leading provider of news and analysis for the telecommunications industry.</p>
<p>Telecomeuropa's co-founder, Peter Purton, will join FT Media and Telecoms as publisher of its telecommunications publicatons. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
